From 5c862b84ba13ab381afa57f1d2949a622627ed1c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:55:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Add a Track physical remote option to Sony Bravia Infrared

Lets people turn off the media player following the Sony remote, for
example when the receiver misses keys. It is on by default, and the
options flow aborts when no receiver is configured.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RrPaBaU6zM6AhoWcyUefct
